#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/common-traits/serde.md:32
msgid ""
"Provides serialization and deserialization functionality for a type, "
"allowing for Rust data types to be converted to/from data formats like JSON."
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/common-traits/serde.md:35
msgid ""
"The standard library doesn't have serialization functionality built-in, but "
"the serde crate is the community standard interface for doing serialization."
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/common-traits/serde.md:38
msgid ""
"When not to implement: If a type contains sensitive data that should not be "
"erroneously saved to disk or sent over a network, consider not implementing "
"Serialize/Deserialize for that type."
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/common-traits/serde.md:42
msgid ""
"Shares security concerns with `Debug`, but given serialization is often used "
"in networking there can be higher stakes."
msgstr ""
